Defining all hooks...
(m2 begin hook) FILE='@__FILE__@', DEPTH=@__DEPTH__@
(file open hook) FILE='foo.m2', DEPTH=1
Foo start
(file suspend hook) FILE='foo.m2', DEPTH=1
(file open hook) FILE='bar', DEPTH=2
Bar start
Bar end
(file close hook) FILE='bar', DEPTH=2
(file resume hook) FILE='foo.m2', DEPTH=1
Foo end
(file close hook) FILE='foo.m2', DEPTH=1
(m2 end hook) FILE='@__FILE__@', DEPTH=@__DEPTH__@
